# Optional: where the SSO page opens, if the default browser is wrong — a work Chrome
# profile rather than a personal one, say. Leave this file out to use the default browser.
#
# Either an account address, resolved to the Chrome profile signed in as it:
you@work.example
#
# ...or a command, for any other browser. The login URL is appended to it:
# open -na "Google Chrome" --args --profile-directory="Profile 2"
# /Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome --profile-directory="Profile 2"
